<title>POLAND: PROCHEM FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.62 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    5.93 vs   2.45</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.67 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.14 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.14 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Sales		   11.17 vs   4.73</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering company is Prochem</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
